  description: 'Strike your target for 1x weapon damage and hurl it away at force 14. A slam, doubled: each body it hits loses 16% of its max health, is staggered and thrown on in turn, so a line of enemies falls like dominoes; into the wall it loses 24% and bounces back. Your own side is never hurt by your throws.'
